              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Caller-controlled paths reach filesystem access without enforced containment within the intended directory or repository."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Resolve the requested path and allowed root, reject paths outside the root using component-aware containment, and use the validated value. FP risk: Medium: intentionally unrestricted file tools and unsupported custom validators require review; string prefixes alone do not prove containment."
              },
